<title>ITALY: Olivetti MD says no talks with Mediaset.</title>
<headline>Olivetti MD says no talks with Mediaset.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Managing Director of Olivetti, Roberto Colaninno, said on Thursday there were no talks in progress with media and advertising group Mediaset over Olivetti's mobile phone venture Omnitel Pronto Italia.</p>
<p>&quot;I know nothing of this, I have not talked to Mediaset about Omnitel,&quot; Colaninno told reporters at an Olivetti conference in the French city of Lyons.</p>
<p>Olivetti shares jumped 5.29 percent on Wednesday and rose further on Thursday on rumours that Olivetti and Mediaset were holding talks on the future of the fast-growing Omnitel business.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
